     [38;5;246mOne append-only event log; feeds computed via a swappable subscription predicate. Lets you change what 'care about'
[39m     [38;5;246mmeans in ten lines, retroactively.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m A — materialized notifications
     [38;5;246mOne record per watcher per event, written at change time. Conventional and simplest to read, but freezes the [39m
     [38;5;246msubscription rule into history.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m C — revision history + diffing
     [38;5;246mStore task versions, derive changes by diff. Most general; spends your effort on version reconciliation rather than
